title Form test
bpm 150
lpb 4
inst fm0 deep_bass
inst fm1 square_lead
inst fm2 strings
pan fm1 L
pan fm2 R
cols fm0 fm1 fm2 psg0 noise dac

pattern intro
mark intro
D-2:70  ...      A-4:40/455  ...    ...  kick
...     ...      ...         ...    w1   ...
A-2:60  ...      A-4:40      D-5:8  ...  snare
...     ...      ...         ...    w1   ...

pattern main
mark main
D-2:110 D-5:90   A-4:60      D-5:4  ...  kick
...     ...      ...         A-5:4  w1   hat
A-2:100 A-4:90   F-4:60      F-5:4  ...  snare
...     F-4:85/4A3 ...       D-5:4  w1   hat

pattern break
mark break
D-2:30  ===      ===         ===    ===  ...
...     ...      ...         ...    ...  ...
...     ...      ...         ...    ...  ...
...     ...      ...         ...    ...  ...

pattern outro
mark outro
D-2:80  D-5:60/A0C ...       ...    ...  kick
...     ===      ...         ...    ...  ...

order intro main*3 break main*3 outro
end
